{"id":"wb-4-70","name":"永陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永陵 (西魏)","text":"永陵是中国西魏文帝元宝炬及其文文皇后乙弗氏合葬陵园，位于陕西省富平县留古乡大冢何家村。封土呈圆丘形，底径80米，高13米。墓前现存石刻一件，高2米余。1996年11月20日公布为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E9%99%B5_(%E8%A5%BF%E9%AD%8F)","revisionId":86485059,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86485059","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5d8787f1d9ed4560559a9fa6.jpg","title":"石兽2-西魏大统十七年（551）-富平西魏文帝（元宝炬）永陵前-西安碑林石刻艺术室.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9F%B3%E5%85%BD2-%E8%A5%BF%E9%AD%8F%E5%A4%A7%E7%BB%9F%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%88551%EF%BC%89-%E5%AF%8C%E5%B9%B3%E8%A5%BF%E9%AD%8F%E6%96%87%E5%B8%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%85%83%E5%AE%9D%E7%82%AC%EF%BC%89%E6%B0%B8%E9%99%B5%E5%89%8D-%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%97%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF%E5%AE%A4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/%E7%9F%B3%E5%85%BD2-%E8%A5%BF%E9%AD%8F%E5%A4%A7%E7%BB%9F%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%88551%EF%BC%89-%E5%AF%8C%E5%B9%B3%E8%A5%BF%E9%AD%8F%E6%96%87%E5%B8%9D%EF%BC%88%E5%85%83%E5%AE%9D%E7%82%AC%EF%BC%89%E6%B0%B8%E9%99%B5%E5%89%8D-%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%97%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF%E5%AE%A4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西安碑林博物馆石刻艺术室藏品","width":320,"height":240}}